The upstream project
--------------------

    Codex CLI  (`codex-cli`, distributed on npm as `@openai/codex`)
    OpenAI
    https://github.com/openai/codex

Established from, in order of directness:

  * The vendored artifacts' own source binaries. The standalone codex releases the
    bundles were extracted from —
    `~/.codex/packages/standalone/releases/{0.147.0,0.153.4}-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin/codex`
    — carry `https://github.com/openai/codex` and `npm install -g @openai/codex` in
