    repository and points its own users at that npm package.
  * `mac/codex-broker/schema-0.147/PROVENANCE.md`, which names the upstream as
    "codex-cli 0.147.0" and records the exact release path the bundle was extracted
    from.
  * The binary's own version banner: `codex --version` prints `codex-cli 0.153.4`.


